      "content": "It must feel unbearable to carry the weight of a lost war while also fighting the battle within yourself. When everything feels broken, the idea of 'progress' seems like a cruel joke. Focus not on fixing the past or envisioning a perfect future, but simply on getting through the next few moments. Allow yourself the space to just *be* exhausted without judgment.",
